# ---- private, per-family data -------------------------------------------
# Committed code refers to children by id (kid1, kid2). Real names and anything
# about a specific child stay out of git. See README.md "Setting it up for your
# kids", and kids.example.json for the field docs.
#
# NOTE: this protects the FUTURE only. Names are already present in this repo's
# history and in the hand-written worksheet-*.html sheets. Removing those needs a
# history rewrite, which is a deliberate call — see README.md "What is and isn't
# scrubbed".
kids.local.json
private/

# Generated drill sheets — regenerable from a seed, and they carry a real name in
# the Name: field. `python3 drill_gen.py --skill div --seed 20260801` rebuilds them
# byte-identically, so tracking them buys nothing and leaks something.
worksheet-division-drill.html
worksheet-multiplication-drill.html
worksheet-division-drill-plain.html
worksheet-multiplication-drill-plain.html
worksheet-facts-drill.html

# Build output of build_site.py. Regenerable; not tracked.
site/

