# ^ ADD EVERY NEW SPEC'S FILE HERE, in the same commit as the spec. This list is
# explicit rather than a worksheet-*.html glob because the hand-written sheets
# above ARE tracked. A generated sheet left off this list sits untracked with a
# real child's name in its Name: field, one `git add -A` away from being
# committed — the Aug 17 pair (immune-*) were missed that way and are added here
# retroactively.

